{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"valid\": true,\n  \"entry\": \"左上方第一块大号米白色文字，因位置靠上、字号最大、亮度最高，首先吸引视线；随后视线容易被下方同样醒目的第二块大字吸引。\",\n  \"grasp_who\": \"仍然想着回去找回曾经的亲近，明知未必能如愿，却还抱着一点希望。\",\n  \"grasp_feel\": \"眷恋、期待、犹豫；具体的恐惧和不安不确定。\",\n  \"missed\": \"他决定暂时不急着回去，先把眼下生活过稳；即使仍然害怕、心里没底，也不想因此收回已经做出的打算。希望、现实处境与继续向前的关系没有在第一眼中清晰呈现。\",\n  \"burden\": [\n    \"两块同样显眼的大字争夺主视线。\",\n    \"单块文字较长，尤其第二块包含好几层意思，需要读完整句才能理清。\",\n    \"核心意思分散在上下两块文字中，需要拼接才能理解他既想回去、又决定先稳住当下的矛盾。\"\n  ],\n  \"score\": 2\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "58cb7b79-e7ba-4082-ac4f-29bdbaa37d93", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261110T012957856065Z", "elapsed_seconds": 27.453, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T01:30:25.313516+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "860e488550c650124987a191b61421171922fa7009e2aed58716a0f41456c38f", "attachment_count": 1}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 1, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261110T012957856065Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "2187fad94775f97a2d3b2a5497d3b307144bb623712953d74645259a58dc07f6"}}}
